{"seq":1,"slug":"frame-rate","title":"帧率与时间基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/frame-rate","wordCount":1120,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"帧率与时间基准\">帧率与时间基准</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>帧率（Frame Rate）定义了视频每秒包含多少个静止画面——它是视频时间维度的基本量化单位。从电影的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> fps 到游戏的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> fps，帧率的选择不仅是技术决策更是美学决策：低帧率带来&quot;电影感&quot;的运动模糊，高帧率带来&quot;真实感&quot;的清晰运动。理解帧率与人眼感知、显示刷新率和编码效率的关系，是视频制作的第一课。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Frame Rate System&lt;br/&gt;帧率体系&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Cinema Standards&lt;br/&gt;电影标准&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Broadcast Standards&lt;br/&gt;广播标准&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Digital/Web&lt;br/&gt;数字/网络&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;24fps&lt;br/&gt;电影&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;48fps&lt;br/&gt;HFR电影&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;25fps (PAL)&lt;br/&gt;欧洲/中国&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;29.97fps (NTSC)&lt;br/&gt;北美/日本&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;30fps&lt;br/&gt;网络通用&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;60fps&lt;br/&gt;游戏/运动&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[&quot;120fps&lt;br/&gt;慢动作/VR&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Frame Rate System&lt;br/&gt;帧率体系\"] --&gt; B[\"Cinema Standards&lt;br/&gt;电影标准\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Broadcast Standards&lt;br/&gt;广播标准\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Digital/Web&lt;br/&gt;数字/网络\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"24fps&lt;br/&gt;电影\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"48fps&lt;br/&gt;HFR电影\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"25fps (PAL)&lt;br/&gt;欧洲/中国\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"29.97fps (NTSC)&lt;br/&gt;北美/日本\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"30fps&lt;br/&gt;网络通用\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"60fps&lt;br/&gt;游戏/运动\"]\n    D --&gt; D3[\"120fps&lt;br/&gt;慢动作/VR\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>帧率（Frame Rate）</strong>：视频每秒包含的静止画面数，是时间维度的分辨率，决定运动的流畅度与模糊量。</li>\n<li><strong>恒定帧率（CFR）与可变帧率（VFR）</strong>：CFR 帧间隔相等、便于编辑与同步，VFR 按处理负载调整、省空间但剪辑困难。</li>\n<li><strong>快门角度</strong>：与帧率共同决定曝光时间和运动模糊量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">180°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180°</span></span></span></span></span> 是电影标准。</li>\n<li><strong>时间码（Timecode）</strong>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HH:MM:SS:FF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 计时的帧级体系，分非丢帧与丢帧两种，后者补偿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>29.97</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">29.97</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">29.97</span></span></span></span></span> fps 的时间漂移。</li>\n<li><strong>高帧率（HFR）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span></span></span></span></span> fps 以上带来更清晰流畅的运动，但会削弱&quot;电影感&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"帧率标准的起源\">帧率标准的起源</h2><h3 id=\"为什么是-24fps\">为什么是 24fps</h3><p>电影帧率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> fps 是 1920 年代的技术妥协产物：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最低不闪烁帧率</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>16</mn><mtext>fps（持续视觉阈值）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最低不闪烁帧率} \\approx 16\\text{fps（持续视觉阈值）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最低不闪烁帧率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fps</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（持续视觉阈值）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>历史因素</th>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人眼闪烁融合</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> fps</td>\n<td>下限确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>胶片成本</td>\n<td>越低越省</td>\n<td>倾向最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声音同步</td>\n<td>需足够长度容纳光学声道</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> fps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准化需求</td>\n<td>行业统一</td>\n<td>定为 24 fps</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"ntsc-29-97fps-的由来\">NTSC 29.97fps 的由来</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>29.97</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>30000</mn><mn>1001</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>1.001</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">29.97 = \\frac{30000}{1001} \\approx 30 \\times \\frac{1}{1.001}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">29.97</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1001</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">30000</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.001</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>1953 年美国引入彩色电视时，为避免色彩副载波与声音载波的干扰，将原 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> fps 降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1%</span></span></span></span></span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>29.97</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">29.97</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">29.97</span></span></span></span></span> fps——这一技术遗产延续至今。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标准</th>\n<th>帧率</th>\n<th>地区</th>\n<th>电力频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NTSC</td>\n<td>29.97 / 59.94</td>\n<td>北美、日本</td>\n<td>60Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PAL</td>\n<td>25 / 50</td>\n<td>欧洲、中国、澳洲</td>\n<td>50Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FILM</td>\n<td>24 / 23.976</td>\n<td>全球电影</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"帧率与运动感知\">帧率与运动感知</h2><h3 id=\"运动模糊量\">运动模糊量</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Motion Blur</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>shutter</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mn>360</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mtext>fps</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Motion Blur} = v \\times t_{\\text{shutter}} = v \\times \\frac{\\theta}{360°} \\times \\frac{1}{\\text{fps}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Motion Blur</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shutter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">360°</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fps</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是快门角度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">180°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180°</span></span></span></span></span> 标准）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>帧率</th>\n<th>标准快门 (180°)</th>\n<th>曝光时间</th>\n<th>运动模糊量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>24fps</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>48</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/48s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/48</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>20.8ms</td>\n<td>最大（电影感）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30fps</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>60</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/60s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>16.7ms</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>60fps</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>120</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/120s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/120</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>8.3ms</td>\n<td>较少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>120fps</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>240</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/240s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/240</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>4.2ms</td>\n<td>极少（超清晰）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"高帧率-hfr-的感知\">高帧率（HFR）的感知</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>帧率</th>\n<th>感知特征</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>24fps</td>\n<td>梦幻、电影感、运动模糊明显</td>\n<td>叙事电影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30fps</td>\n<td>自然、介于电影与真实之间</td>\n<td>网络内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>48fps</td>\n<td>更清晰但部分观众觉得&quot;太真实&quot;</td>\n<td>HFR电影（《霍比特人》）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>60fps</td>\n<td>流畅、真实、运动清晰</td>\n<td>体育、游戏、VR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>120fps</td>\n<td>极度流畅、慢动作素材</td>\n<td>体育回放、VR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"可变帧率与恒定帧率\">可变帧率与恒定帧率</h2><h3 id=\"cfr-vs-vfr\">CFR vs VFR</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CFR (恒定帧率)</td>\n<td>每帧间隔完全相等</td>\n<td>编辑兼容、同步精确</td>\n<td>不能适应场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VFR (可变帧率)</td>\n<td>帧间隔可变</td>\n<td>节省空间、适应复杂度</td>\n<td>剪辑/同步困难</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>手机录制通常为 VFR（根据处理负载调整），专业拍摄要求 CFR。VFR 视频在剪辑软件中可能产生音画不同步——需转码为 CFR。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"时间码系统\">时间码系统</h2><h3 id=\"smpte-时间码\">SMPTE 时间码</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Timecode</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>时:分:秒:帧</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Timecode} = HH:MM:SS:FF \\quad (\\text{时:分:秒:帧})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Timecode</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">秒</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">帧</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间码类型</th>\n<th>帧率</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>非丢帧 (NDF)</td>\n<td>24/25/30</td>\n<td>严格计数</td>\n<td>电影/PAL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丢帧 (DF)</td>\n<td>29.97</td>\n<td>跳过特定帧号</td>\n<td>NTSC 广播</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>丢帧时间码每分钟跳过帧号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">00</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">01</span></span></span></span></span>（除每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟外），使时间码与实际时间同步：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>漂移</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>29.97</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.8</mn><mtext> 帧/分钟</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> 帧/分钟（丢帧补偿量）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{漂移} = (30 - 29.97) \\times 60 = 1.8 \\text{ 帧/分钟} \\approx 2 \\text{ 帧/分钟（丢帧补偿量）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">漂移</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">29.97</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">帧</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分钟</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">帧</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分钟（丢帧补偿量）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"2025-2026-帧率趋势\">2025-2026 帧率趋势</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>趋势</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手机 4K 120fps</td>\n<td>iPhone 16 Pro / Galaxy S25 Ultra 标配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 帧插值</td>\n<td>NVIDIA DLSS Frame Generation / AMD FSR 3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可变刷新率 (VRR)</td>\n<td>FreeSync/G-Sync 匹配帧率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电影 48fps 尝试</td>\n<td>James Cameron《阿凡达》系列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短视频 60fps</td>\n<td>抖音/TikTok 高帧率上传支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>帧率是视频的时间分辨率——它决定了运动的流畅度、模糊量和文件大小。选择帧率是技术约束与美学偏好的平衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>帧率</th>\n<th>编码码率影响</th>\n<th>美学</th>\n<th>最佳场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>24fps</td>\n<td>基准 (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>)</td>\n<td>电影感</td>\n<td>叙事/剧情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30fps</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.25</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.25\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>自然</td>\n<td>网络/Vlog</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>60fps</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>流畅</td>\n<td>运动/游戏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>120fps</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>超流畅/慢动作源</td>\n<td>VR/体育/后期变速</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"帧率与时间基准","id":"帧率与时间基准"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"帧率标准的起源","id":"帧率标准的起源"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么是 24fps","id":"为什么是-24fps"},{"level":3,"text":"NTSC 29.97fps 的由来","id":"ntsc-29-97fps-的由来"},{"level":2,"text":"帧率与运动感知","id":"帧率与运动感知"},{"level":3,"text":"运动模糊量","id":"运动模糊量"},{"level":3,"text":"高帧率（HFR）的感知","id":"高帧率-hfr-的感知"},{"level":2,"text":"可变帧率与恒定帧率","id":"可变帧率与恒定帧率"},{"level":3,"text":"CFR vs VFR","id":"cfr-vs-vfr"},{"level":2,"text":"时间码系统","id":"时间码系统"},{"level":3,"text":"SMPTE 时间码","id":"smpte-时间码"},{"level":2,"text":"2025-2026 帧率趋势","id":"2025-2026-帧率趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"分辨率与像素密度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/resolution"}}